%description:
Tests windowShrinkAllowed, as Linux with tcp_shrink_window=1. The server has a
receive buffer of 20000 bytes, so its first offer is half of it (10000), and
its application reads late. Each 1000-byte segment costs the truesize of its
Linux skb (2280 bytes), and the free buffer counts at the measured ratio of
payload to truesize (112/256). So the offer falls faster than the data arrives:
7752 after the first segment, which moves the right edge back (1001 + 7752 is
less than 10001), and 0 after 8000 bytes.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 2s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 8000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.receiveBufferSize = 20000B
*.srv_tcp.windowShrinkAllowed = true
*.srv_app.autoRead=false
*.srv_app.readScript="3 20000"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.003 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 500:500(0) ack 1 win 10000   Option(s): MaxSegSize
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.005 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 501 win 16384 
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.003 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 7752 
[1.005 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1001:2001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.005 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:3001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.007 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 6755 
[1.007 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3001 win 5757 
[1.009 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A 3001:4001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.009 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 4001:5001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.009 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 5001:6001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.009 A009] A.1000 > B.2000: A 6001:7001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.011 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 4001 win 4760 
[1.011 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 5001 win 3762 
[1.011 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 6001 win 2765 
[1.011 B008] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 7001 win 1767 
[1.013 A010] A.1000 > B.2000: A 7001:8001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.015 B009] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 8001 win 0 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
